WEBVTT

00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.086
I had to stop on the 
Trans-Labrador Highway for hours

00:01:30.086 --> 00:01:32.630
as the George River caribou herd crossed.

00:01:33.214 --> 00:01:36.509
There were hundreds
of thousands in the herd then.

00:01:37.051 --> 00:01:40.096
Now, there are only 8,000 left.

00:01:41.055 --> 00:01:44.016
I've seen firsthand the devastating
impact of climate change

00:01:44.016 --> 00:01:47.478
and the loss of biodiversity
in my homeland of Nitassinan

00:01:47.478 --> 00:01:50.606
and all across what is now
known as Canada.

00:01:51.774 --> 00:01:54.527
But I’ve also seen something else,

00:01:54.902 --> 00:01:57.405
something that gives me hope.

00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:00.324
It’s not a technology from a lab.